Output "sites/bookshelf/assets/bookshelf-demo.mp4"

Set Shell "zsh"
Set Width 1440
Set Height 900
Set FontSize 24
Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono"
Set TypingSpeed 55ms
Set Theme "OneDark"
Set Padding 28

Hide
Type "export PS1='❯ '; alias claude='zsh videos/cli-recordings/bookshelf-claude-demo.sh'; clear"
Enter
Show

Type "claude"
Enter
Sleep 14s
